{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012QBNDhhHXpFRRygtSAQxYJ","type":"tool_result","content":"680\t\n681\t<h2>Long-term Housing Strategy</h2>\n682\t<p>Once you've secured your job and work pass, apartment hunting shifts from monthly stays to 12-month leases. <a href=\"/getting-here\">Getting to Pelangi from the Causeway</a> is 10–15 minutes by Grab, so proximity to the hostel signals good transport connections for future housing. Target neighbourhoods: Taman Pelangi, Danga Bay, Larkin. Monthly rents: RM800–1,500 for 1-bedroom private flats in these areas.</p>\n683\t\n684\t<h2>Making the Commute Sustainable</h2>\n685\t<p>Daily commuting is sustainable, not glamorous. The Causeway is reliable. Weather delays (rare) add 10–15 minutes. Strikes or roadwork (annual) are predictable and avoidable. Most commuters find the rhythm within 2 weeks. The financial upside — SGD50,000+ annual savings — justifies the daily 1.5-hour round trip.</p>\n686\t\n687\t<p>Ready to cross the Causeway? <a href=\"/rooms\">Book a stay at Pelangi Capsule</a> as your first base, and start your cross-border career today.</p>\n688\t`,\n689\t  },\n690\t];\n691\t\n692\texport const blogPosts: BlogPost[] = rawPosts.map((post) => ({\n693\t  ...post,\n694\t  readingTimeMinutes: computeReadingTime(post.content),\n695\t}));\n696\t\n697\texport function getPostBySlug(slug: string): BlogPost | undefined {\n698\t  return blogPosts.find((post) => post.slug === slug);\n699\t}\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d7a92fd6-4b90-4f55-947c-fcfa8dd3d055","uuid":"50e2aee6-5c81-43e3-b90b-a06c299bde13","timestamp":"2026-04-13T20:49:19.447Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\data\\blog\\posts.ts","content":"\n<h2>Long-term Housing Strategy</h2>\n<p>Once you've secured your job and work pass, apartment hunting shifts from monthly stays to 12-month leases. <a href=\"/getting-here\">Getting to Pelangi from the Causeway</a> is 10–15 minutes by Grab, so proximity to the hostel signals good transport connections for future housing. Target neighbourhoods: Taman Pelangi, Danga Bay, Larkin. Monthly rents: RM800–1,500 for 1-bedroom private flats in these areas.</p>\n\n<h2>Making the Commute Sustainable</h2>\n<p>Daily commuting is sustainable, not glamorous. The Causeway is reliable. Weather delays (rare) add 10–15 minutes. Strikes or roadwork (annual) are predictable and avoidable. Most commuters find the rhythm within 2 weeks. The financial upside — SGD50,000+ annual savings — justifies the daily 1.5-hour round trip.</p>\n\n<p>Ready to cross the Causeway? <a href=\"/rooms\">Book a stay at Pelangi Capsule</a> as your first base, and start your cross-border career today.</p>\n`,\n  },\n];\n\nexport const blogPosts: BlogPost[] = rawPosts.map((post) => ({\n  ...post,\n  readingTimeMinutes: computeReadingTime(post.content),\n}));\n\nexport function getPostBySlug(slug: string): BlogPost | undefined {\n  return blogPosts.find((post) => post.slug === slug);\n}","numLines":20,"startLine":680,"totalLines":700}}}
